# icp's draft routes (core/modules/icp/README.md "Routes", "The draft"): the ICP drafted by the worker
# from Company Knowledge and a brief, then used or discarded on the ICP screen. The draft, the accept
# and the discard are idempotent: each Idempotency-Key is an example UUID; another one makes a new
# request, the same one answers the first answer again for a day. Without a drafted proposal, the
# accept and the discard answer 409 icp_draft_none. The accept sends the proposal's run, GET's
# pending.runId, as {{draftRunId}} from the private file: another run's is icp_draft_none too. A write
# sends the cookie, so it sends Origin: {{appOrigin}} too (the api's origin check). Each route acts on
# the default audience; `?icpId=<id>` after its path names another of the workspace's (gamma-p3-020),
# and an id the workspace does not hold is 404 icp_not_found.

### GET /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/icp/draft: the latest draft, its proposal and whether Company Knowledge has a field
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/icp/draft
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/icp/draft: drafts from Company Knowledge and the brief; 202, drafting
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/icp/draft
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000401

{ "brief": "Small logistics firms in France that ship parcels every day." }

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/icp/draft/accept: saves the drafted name and targeting; replace also over targeting
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/icp/draft/accept
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000402

{ "replace": false, "runId": "{{draftRunId}}" }

### POST /v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/icp/draft/discard: discards the drafted proposal; the ICP keeps every field
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/icp/draft/discard
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{sessionCookie}}
Origin: {{appOrigin}}
Idempotency-Key: 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000403
